## 1. Parent-Ticket Branch Naming (`G2`, `M3`)

A work branch represents **one Parent Feature / Work Item Ticket** (`M3`). Do not create separate branches for each sub-task inside a feature unless the user explicitly requests sub-branches:

- **Format with Parent Ticket**: `{{branch_pattern}}` (lowercase, hyphen-separated words, no developer names, confirmed by the user after Gate 1).
- **Format without Ticket ID** (only when the user confirms no ticket exists): `<type>/<short-description>` confirmed by the user.
- **Release candidate branch**: `{{release_pattern}}`.
- **Forbidden branch names**: Personal names (`john/fix`, `nam-dev`), vague placeholders (`fix-bug`, `update-ui`, `temp-test`, `final-v2`).

