### 3.2 Hotfix Propagation Across Active Lines (`G5`, `G6`)

Every production hotfix (`hotfix/<TICKET>-<short-desc>` branched from `{{production_branch}}`) must reach **every active line** so the next release never re-introduces the bug:

| Target Line | Propagation Rule |
|---|---|
{{propagation_rows}}

- **No cherry-pick promotion (`G6`)**: Never promote feature work across `{{integration_branch}}` → `{{release_pattern}}` → `{{production_branch}}` using `git cherry-pick`. Cherry-pick is restricted to documented emergency backports where merging the hotfix branch would pull unrelated history.

